n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">## Proof</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">Apply part (i) of Theorem 1 of Fixture2000 to the underlying complex. [uses `Fixture2000.Thm_1`]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">## Description</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">A later theorem cites the earlier two-part theorem through an explicit fully qualified name.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">namespace</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Fixture2001</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/-- **Theorem 1** (Fixture2001). Apply part (i) of Fixture2000 Theorem 1 to the underlying complex. -/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">theorem</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> degree_add_zero</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (c : PointedToyComplex) : c.complex.degree + </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> = c.complex.degree :=</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  Fixture2000.degree_add_zero c.complex</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">end</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Fixture2001</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre>",
    "source_text": "import HomAlg.Fixture2001.Def_1\nimport HomAlg.Fixture2000.Def_1\nimport HomAlg.Fixture2000.Thm_1\n\n/-!\n```yaml node\n{\n  \"id\": \"Fixture2001.Thm_1\",\n  \"kind\": \"theorem\",\n  \"doc\": \"Fixture2001\",\n  \"source\": {\n    \"chapter\": \"1\",\n    \"section\": \"1.1\",\n    \"label\": \"Theorem 1\",\n    \"pages\": [\n      1\n    ]\n  },\n  \"title\": \"Theorem 1\",\n  \"tags\": [\n    \"chain-complex\",\n    \"basic\"\n  ],\n  \"concepts\": {\n    \"defines\": [],\n    \"uses\": []\n  },\n  \"deps\": {\n    \"statement\": [\n      \"Fixture2001.Def_1\",\n      \"Fixture2000.Def_1\"\n    ],\n    \"proof\": [\n      \"Fixture2000.Thm_1\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"decls\": [\n    \"Fixture2001.degree_add_zero\"\n  ],\n  \"fidelity\": {\n    \"status\": \"faithful\"\n  },\n  \"nl_proof_source\": {\n    \"follows\": \"document\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Statement\n\nIf $C$ is a pointed toy chain complex, the degree of its underlying complex is unchanged by adding zero.\n\n## Proof\n\nApply part (i) of Theorem 1 of Fixture2000 to the underlying complex. [uses `Fixture2000.Thm_1`]\n\n## Description\n\nA later theorem cites the earlier two-part theorem through an explicit fully qualified name.\n-/\n\nnamespace Fixture2001\n\n/-- **Theorem 1** (Fixture2001). Apply part (i) of Fixture2000 Theorem 1 to the underlying complex. -/\ntheorem degree_add_zero (c : PointedToyComplex) : c.complex.degree + 0 = c.complex.degree :=\n  Fixture2000.degree_add_zero c.complex\n\nend Fixture2001\n"
